  "title": "Rich and Creamy Roasted Eggplant Soup",
  "description": "Roasted eggplant, tomato, onion and garlic are seasoned with thyme, pureed, then heated with cream and topped with goat cheese in this rich soup.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
  ],
